WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.647 --> 00:00:02.459
Use LEAP.

2
00:00:02.718 --> 00:00:06.860
Listen - let them speak, nod, don't interrupt.

3
00:00:07.119 --> 00:00:11.260
Most people calm down once they feel heard.

4
00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:17.214
Empathise - show you understand: 'You don't want to miss kick-off.'

5
00:00:17.473 --> 00:00:22.650
Ask - questions that help: 'Can I see your ticket?'

6
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:26.015
Then Propose - give them options.

7
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:29.898
Two choices are better than an order.

8
00:00:30.157 --> 00:00:37.923
'Your gate's five minutes this way - or I can call my supervisor to check.'
